(Oceanic Maritime Logistics - Employee Policy Manual) '
(Document Ref: OML-HR-POL-01 | Classification: Internal) '
(Section 1: Working Hours and Attendance Guidelines) '
(Standard working hours for full-time shore staff are 40 hours per week.) '
(Work schedule is Monday to Friday, 09:00 to 17:30 with a 30-minute unpaid lunch break.) '
(Core operating hours are 10:00 to 15:00 local time, during which all staff must be reachable.) '
(Overtime eligibility: Non-exempt maritime operations support staff receive 1.5x regular hourly wage for hours worked beyond 40 hours.) '
(Overtime requires pre-authorization by department manager at least 24 hours in advance.) '
(Absence notification requirement: Employees must inform their line manager at least 60 minutes before scheduled start time.) '
ET
endstream
endobj
