<< /Length 1038 >>
stream
BT
/F1 11 Tf
50 740 Td
14 TL
(Section 2: Paid Leave Entitlements and Accrual) '
(Annual leave entitlement: Full-time employees accrue 22 working days of paid annual leave per calendar year.) '
(Annual leave accrues monthly at the rate of 1.83 working days per completed month of active service.) '
(Maximum annual leave rollover: Up to 5 unused annual leave days may be carried forward into the subsequent calendar year.) '
(Carried-forward annual leave must be utilized before March 31 of the new calendar year or it is forfeited.) '
(Sick leave quota: Employees receive 10 paid sick days per calendar year credited on January 1.) '
(Medical certification rule: A registered physician medical certificate is mandatory for consecutive sick leave absences exceeding 3 days.) '
(Bereavement leave: 5 consecutive paid working days for immediate family members and 3 paid days for extended family.) '
(Parental leave: 16 weeks fully paid primary caregiver leave, and 6 weeks fully paid secondary caregiver leave after 12 months service.) '
ET
endstream
endobj
